Agent: Runtime

Purpose:
  Defines agent runtime state for crash recovery and session
  management.

AgentConfig:
  Mode:
    AUTO | SUPERVISED | STRICT | AUDIT | READ_ONLY

  Project:
    <project-name>

  SessionID:
    <session-id>

Session:
  Started:
    <timestamp>

  CurrentTask:
    <task-id>

  CurrentPhase:
    <phase>

  LastStep:
    <last-successful-step>

  NextAction:
    <next-action>

Checkpoint:
  Format:
    CHECKPOINT-<timestamp>-<task-id>

  Contents:
    - Task state
    - Phase state
    - Generated files
    - Test results
    - Gate results

Recovery:
  On crash:
    Read .sdd/runtime/current.sdd
    Resume from exact state
    Do NOT restart workflow

RuntimeRules:
  [RT1]  Agent state MUST be persisted after each step.
  [RT2]  Crash recovery MUST resume from exact state.
  [RT3]  Agent MUST NOT restart workflow on recovery.
  [RT4]  Checkpoints MUST be created before risky operations.

State: +
  